@startuml
title Factory Method: создание потребителя электроэнергии

interface PowerConsumer {
  +description() : String
  +allocatedPowerKw() : double
}

abstract class ConsumerCreator {
  +{abstract} createConsumer(allocatedPowerKw : double) : PowerConsumer
}

class IndustrialConsumer
class ResidentialConsumer
class MunicipalConsumer
class AgriculturalConsumer

class IndustrialConsumerCreator
class ResidentialConsumerCreator
class MunicipalConsumerCreator
class AgriculturalConsumerCreator

PowerConsumer <|.. IndustrialConsumer
PowerConsumer <|.. ResidentialConsumer
PowerConsumer <|.. MunicipalConsumer
PowerConsumer <|.. AgriculturalConsumer

ConsumerCreator <|-- IndustrialConsumerCreator
ConsumerCreator <|-- ResidentialConsumerCreator
ConsumerCreator <|-- MunicipalConsumerCreator
ConsumerCreator <|-- AgriculturalConsumerCreator

ConsumerCreator ..> PowerConsumer : создаёт
IndustrialConsumerCreator ..> IndustrialConsumer
ResidentialConsumerCreator ..> ResidentialConsumer
MunicipalConsumerCreator ..> MunicipalConsumer
AgriculturalConsumerCreator ..> AgriculturalConsumer
@enduml
